    "_odds": "筑基 follows the book (story DESIGN § 定例 · 沉鼎观的数; 2026-10-03): without a pill about one in ten gets through (base 10), the sect's one 一转 lifts it to a few in ten, a 九转 makes it near-certain. `floor` 5: a throw is never hopeless."
